WEBVTT

00:04:29.570 --> 00:04:31.131
And this is probably the reason

00:04:31.155 --> 00:04:35.726
that you've never been told
to stay awake on a problem.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:39.616
Instead, you're told
to sleep on a problem,

00:04:39.640 --> 00:04:42.103
and that's exactly
what the science teaching us.